      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Indian River Shores is part of the Sebastian‑Vero Beach‑West Vero Corridor Metropolitan Area, the northernmost segment of the South Florida Combined Statistical Area.",
